{
  "mn34:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 34 ",
  "mn34:0.2": "Cūḷagopālakasutta ",
  "mn34:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn34:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā vajjīsu viharati ukkacelāyaṁ gaṅgāya nadiyā tīre. ",
  "mn34:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn34:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn34:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn34:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn34:2.1": "“Bhūtapubbaṁ, bhikkhave, māgadhako gopālako duppaññajātiko, vassānaṁ pacchime māse saradasamaye, asamavekkhitvā gaṅgāya nadiyā orimaṁ tīraṁ, asamavekkhitvā pārimaṁ tīraṁ, atittheneva gāvo patāresi uttaraṁ tīraṁ suvidehānaṁ. ",
  "mn34:3.1": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, gāvo majjhegaṅgāya nadiyā sote āmaṇḍaliyaṁ karitvā tattheva anayabyasanaṁ āpajjiṁsu. ",
  "mn34:3.2": "Taṁ kissa hetu? ",
  "mn34:3.3": "Tathā hi so, bhikkhave, māgadhako gopālako duppaññajātiko, vassānaṁ pacchime māse saradasamaye, asamavekkhitvā gaṅgāya nadiyā orimaṁ tīraṁ, asamavekkhitvā pārimaṁ tīraṁ, atittheneva gāvo patāresi uttaraṁ tīraṁ suvidehānaṁ. ",
  "mn34:3.4": "Evameva kho, bhikkhave, ye hi keci samaṇā vā brāhmaṇā vā akusalā imassa lokassa akusalā parassa lokassa, akusalā māradheyyassa akusalā amāradheyyassa, akusalā maccudheyyassa akusalā amaccudheyyassa, tesaṁ ye sotabbaṁ saddahātabbaṁ maññissanti, tesaṁ taṁ bhavissati dīgharattaṁ ahitāya dukkhāya. ",
  "mn34:4.1": "Bhūtapub